1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,930
The original body is here.

25
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,470
Master,

26
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:24,480
this purple core feels like a Nascent Soul.

27
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:26,310
It seems that the Divine Path

28
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:28,510
is the right way to breakthrough with the Ji Realm.

29
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:38,600
It's an upper Spirit Beast.

30
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:41,420
With my avatar's cultivation,

31
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:43,930
I couldn't see that its soul was still there.

32
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:48,610
Such hostility in his soul...

33
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:50,730
How painful was his death ?

34
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,890
Master,

35
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:54,430
it's about to dissipate !

36
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:56,290
Since we met before,

37
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,530
I'll save you.

38
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,810
From now on,

39
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:28,120
you're my third devil.

40
00:03:35,730 --> 00:03:36,690
Junior Sister,

41
00:03:36,830 --> 00:03:38,810
where are you going ?

42
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,970
Did something happen ?

43
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:42,290
Junior Sister,

44
00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:44,090
you haven't answered yet.

45
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:46,250
What happened ?

46
00:03:45,990 --> 00:03:47,090
Where are you going ?

47
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:47,890
Sun Zhenwei,

48
00:03:48,550 --> 00:03:50,050
do you really think that

49
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,970
your Late stage Core Formation cultivation

50
00:03:51,990 --> 00:03:54,290
is enough to stop me ?

51
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,810
If you don't step aside now,

52
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:57,730
then don't blame me for being ruthless.

53
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:00,450
Junior Sister,

54
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,410
this is the Cloud Sky Sect.

55
00:04:02,300 --> 00:04:04,050
Why would I dare to stop you ?

56
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:08,170
You can go anywhere you want.

57
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:10,430
I'll be happy to accompany you.

58
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:26,970
Sun Hai
Early stage Core Formation

59
00:04:23,570 --> 00:04:25,210
Little rabbit,

60
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:27,250
I already told you that

61
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:29,410
those girls are nothing but trouble.

62
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,570
You never listen !

63
00:04:32,170 --> 00:04:34,090
Especially this girl,

64
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:35,410
she's very cunning.

65
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:37,500
She's not someone you can handle.

66
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,850
Are you happy now ?

67
00:04:43,550 --> 00:04:45,690
I know you're frustrated

68
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:48,810
but I have no choice except restraining you for now.

69
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:51,210
The Eastern Courtyard has already sent word.

70
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:52,930
If you keep causing trouble,

71
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:55,330
they will shatter your cultivation.

72
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:16,490
That woman really is despicable.

73
00:05:16,470 --> 00:05:20,810
They even sent an outer sect elder to kill me.

74
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,090
Come.

75
00:05:22,910 --> 00:05:24,810
Kill me, I'm not scared.

76
00:05:24,670 --> 00:05:26,400
If I blink,

77
00:05:26,540 --> 00:05:28,570
then my name is not Cheng Xian !

78
00:05:29,330 --> 00:05:31,370
I was indeed asked by someone to come

79
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,730
but to help you, not kill you.

80
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:34,960
Tell me,

81
00:05:35,910 --> 00:05:37,490
what happened ?

82
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:40,730
Senior,

83
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:42,120
who asked you to help me ?

84
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,890
I will only give you 3 sentences

85
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:46,090
and that was the first one.

86
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:51,210
Cheng Ling from the Eastern Courtyard...

87
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:51,970
It's her fault !

88
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:54,410
She caused all this !

89
00:05:55,210 --> 00:05:57,240
The real reason she got close to me

90
00:05:57,030 --> 00:05:59,170
was because she was after my two Spirit Apes.

91
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:02,580
Were they yours ?

92
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:05,270
I know what Senior means.

93
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:08,130
There are many beasts in the Cloud Sky Sect

94
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:10,770
and they can be used for alchemy.

95
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:13,560
The beasts in the sect

96
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:15,180
are just tools.

97
00:06:15,390 --> 00:06:17,210
But I brought them with me

98
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:19,290
when I joined the sect.

99
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:22,130
According to the Cloud Sky Sect's rules

100
00:06:22,380 --> 00:06:24,370
those two belong to me.

101
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:26,660
So this Cheng Ling got close to you,

102
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:28,250
then asked for the two Spirit Apes.

103
00:06:28,630 --> 00:06:30,530
You wanted to please her

104
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,250
so you handed them over to her.

105
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,570
Correct ?

106
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:34,930
But...

107
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:37,740
But I thought she wanted mounts.

108
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:40,050
I never thought her goal was their Core.

109
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,330
Big Ape

110
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:43,370
already got his Core removed !

111
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:45,570
Only Small Ape is left.

112
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:48,330
I went many times to get him back,

113
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,730
but I wasn't allowed inside.

114
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:51,210
It was an outer sect disciple

115
00:06:50,960 --> 00:06:52,370
who hurt me.

116
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:54,610
I'm afraid that

117
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:57,570
my Spirit Ape is in danger.

118
00:06:58,520 --> 00:06:59,850
This is weird.

119
00:07:00,500 --> 00:07:02,330
Cheng Ling's cultivation is very low.

120
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,810
She can't need Beast Cores yet.

121
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:06,970
Someone else is behind all this.

122
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:10,130
Cheng Xian helped me before,

123
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,770
so I will help him

124
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:13,070
as much as I can.

125
00:07:13,660 --> 00:07:15,010
What should I do ?

126
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,770
Please bring back

127
00:07:19,070 --> 00:07:20,610
Small Ape.

128
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,220
Junior Sister,

129
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:29,130
what are you doing ?

130
00:07:40,850 --> 00:07:42,770
I know you are here.

131
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,690
Why aren't you willing to meet me ?

132
00:07:44,570 --> 00:07:45,650
Not even once.

133
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:50,530
Junior Sister,

134
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,050
who are you talking to ?

135
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:55,040
Wan'er doesn't ask anything else

136
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,930
but to see you once more.

137
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,090
Over the past 200 years,

138
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:03,370
I've been relying on the spirit liquid to keep my vitality.

139
00:08:03,790 --> 00:08:06,410
But if you aren't willing to come out,

140
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:08,250
then Wan'er will kill herself right now.

141
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:11,010
To release myself

142
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:13,530
from this obsession.

143
00:08:16,530 --> 00:08:18,810
Why are you like this ?

144
00:08:23,990 --> 00:08:26,280
The moment your hand touches your bag of holding

145
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:27,930
is the moment you die.

146
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:33,210
Through the remnants of night, the Dao dreams

147
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:33,210
as years and seasons swirl unending.

148
00:08:29,150 --> 00:08:31,170
This person is at Core Formation

149
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:33,770
but he gives off the feeling of a Nascent Soul...

150
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:41,210
Renegade Immortals cultivate thousands of years

151
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:41,210
to reach perfection.

152
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:37,970
Since Brother is Junior Sister Li's friend,

153
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:40,610
you are also the Cloud Sky Sect's friend.

154
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:42,370
If I was rude before,

155
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:43,970
it's a misunderstanding.

156
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:48,090
Pursuing immortality, understanding life and death, Karma and the Dao,

157
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:48,090
is very difficult.

158
00:08:47,870 --> 00:08:51,730
Defying the heavens

159
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:51,730
requires resolve

160
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,890
Do you still have

161
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:51,250
that jade slip ?

162
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,490
I threw it away.

163
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:56,080
day after day, night after night,
through wind and snow, through this human life

164
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:59,960
Like a flying sword

165
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,960
soaring through the sky,

166
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:58,810
Since you threw it away...

167
00:08:58,920 --> 00:09:01,490
Well, it wasn't anything valuable.

168
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:03,780
my aspirations are higher.

169
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:03,570
I'm leaving.

170
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:07,760
I will transcend

171
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:07,760
and break free from the reincarnation cycle.

172
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:11,330
Yet my love never grows old.

173
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,740
The Cloud Sky Sect Ancestors

174
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:12,530
want me to form a cultivation pair with this person.

175
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:15,210
I can turn into an Immortal

176
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:15,210
and defy the heavens

177
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:15,820
Before, I kept rejecting him...

178
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:18,770
but the flowers keep withering.

179
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:18,810
But now, I have no reasons left...

180
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:22,650
My love and resentment

181
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:22,650
are entangled in my heart

182
00:09:20,110 --> 00:09:22,430
If you're still in the country in 3 months,

183
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:26,210
for this unrepentant vow.

184
00:09:23,130 --> 00:09:26,180
then please come to the ceremony.

185
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:30,570
I have forgotten

186
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,570
what year it is

187
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,050
Congratulations.

188
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:34,070
but I cannot forget your face.

189
00:09:33,870 --> 00:09:38,010
I can turn into an Immortal

190
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:38,010
and defy the heavens

191
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:41,570
but the flowers keep withering.

192
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:41,770
I hate you...

193
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:45,650
My love and resentment

194
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,650
are entangled in my heart

195
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:44,300
I hate you !!!

196
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:49,210
for this unrepentant vow.

197
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:47,710
Junior Sister,

198
00:09:48,050 --> 00:09:49,240
he already left.

199
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:56,850
You bitch !

200
00:09:57,680 --> 00:10:00,730
Note: Primordial Yin = virginity

201
00:09:57,680 --> 00:10:00,730
Wait until I snatch your 200 years of Primordial Yin energy.

202
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:02,530
I will humiliate you

203
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:05,830
for rejecting me for so long !

204
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:09,490
As for this guy...

205
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:22,290
The Cloud Sky Sect Ancestors

206
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:25,250
want me to form a cultivation pair with this person.

207
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:28,090
If you're still in the country in 3 months,

208
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:31,330
then please come to the ceremony.

209
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,170
Master !

210
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:32,970
Master ?

211
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:37,350
Looks like his heart is in turmoil.

212
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:39,450
I'd better not disturb him now.

213
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:54,290
Sun Lingwu 
Cloud Sky Sect Elder
Middle stage Nascent Soul

214
00:10:46,970 --> 00:10:51,450
You can't come and go as you wish here.

215
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:54,970
Do you look down on our Cloud Sky Sect ?

216
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,450
Here comes a big problem !

217
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:58,190
He's obviously Nascent Soul.

218
00:10:59,410 --> 00:11:01,130
You overestimate yourself.

219
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:10,390
You're looking for death !

220
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,890
Master, this old man is too strong.

221
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:21,920
We should leave while we still can.

222
00:11:23,830 --> 00:11:24,870
Merge !

223
00:11:32,250 --> 00:11:33,030
This is bad.

224
00:11:37,980 --> 00:11:39,130
What's happening !?

225
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:41,450
Quick, protect the pill furnaces !

226
00:11:41,170 --> 00:11:42,880
Master, I'm here. Save me !

227
00:11:43,010 --> 00:11:44,610
Warn the Elders,

228
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,930
quick !

229
00:11:58,730 --> 00:12:00,690
Little rat...

230
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:23,400
He won't come after us, will he ?

231
00:12:23,660 --> 00:12:25,850
I've recovered my low cultivation.

232
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,850
No one will suspect me.

233
00:12:28,110 --> 00:12:29,590
Follow Cheng Ling

234
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:31,850
and find out who's behind her.

235
00:12:31,610 --> 00:12:32,550
Who ?

236
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,270
Me ?

237
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:38,400
Or, you can go and talk with the Nascent Soul guy.

238
00:12:38,510 --> 00:12:39,530
It's up to you.

239
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:44,570
Master,

240
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:46,040
Master,

241
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:48,810
you're too weak for now.

242
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:51,260
I have to protect you.

243
00:12:52,740 --> 00:12:54,050
Okay...

244
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:06,130
Junior Brother,

245
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,530
I have been ordered

246
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:08,930
to decorate the Northern Courtyard.

247
00:13:24,280 --> 00:13:25,370
This is...

248
00:13:26,390 --> 00:13:27,610
Your Grandmaster,

249
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:28,650
Elder Li Muwan

250
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:30,410
and Sun Zhenwei's marriage

251
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,730
is scheduled in 2 months.

252
00:13:32,090 --> 00:13:33,890
The invitations have been sent out.

253
00:13:33,790 --> 00:13:35,990
The sect has to be decorated as soon as possible.

254
00:13:42,330 --> 00:13:44,590
Before, I kept rejecting him...

255
00:13:45,540 --> 00:13:48,170
But now, I have no reasons left...

256
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,490
Master, Master !

257
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:52,690
Look !

258
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:54,690
I'm blessed.

259
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:07,170
Bad Senior,

260
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:10,290
I helped you to get the Spirit Ape to make pills.

261
00:14:10,270 --> 00:14:13,970
Yet why are you marrying that old hag Li Muwan ?

262
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:16,210
What about Ling'er ?

263
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:18,730
I love you the most.

264
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:20,050
But Ling'er,

265
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:23,640
do you want to know why I have to marry that old hag ?

266
00:14:24,660 --> 00:14:26,970
She has 200 years of Primordial Yin.

267
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:28,550
When I get her,

268
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:31,090
she will be nothing more

269
00:14:31,510 --> 00:14:32,790
than my food

270
00:14:32,980 --> 00:14:34,990
to help me reach Nascent Soul.

271
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:37,780
Are you still competing with her ?

272
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,170
Senior,

273
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:43,950
you're so mean !

274
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:47,350
I'll tell you

275
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,860
what I think of her.

276
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:51,510
How can anyone like her ?

277
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:53,770
She always wears a sad face

278
00:14:53,520 --> 00:14:55,330
while pretending to be noble and pure.

279
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:57,330
Do you think she looks good ?

280
00:14:57,150 --> 00:14:58,770
Kill them both.

281
00:14:59,020 --> 00:15:00,240
Senior...

282
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:00,690
Okay !

283
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:02,650
What about us ?

284
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:14,730
Shit !

285
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:15,410
This is bad.

286
00:15:15,160 --> 00:15:17,000
He has a defensive artifact.

287
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,620
By the way Master,

288
00:15:18,390 --> 00:15:21,170
this guy has a Nascent Soul father protecting him.

289
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:23,050
It's the one we met earlier.

290
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:24,130
Someone !

291
00:15:24,110 --> 00:15:25,210
Hurry, help !

292
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:29,090
He must die.

293
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,650
Disciple Wang Lin

294
00:15:37,530 --> 00:15:39,360
pays respect to Grandteacher.

295
00:15:40,870 --> 00:15:43,610
Your master is about to come out of seclusion.

296
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:45,500
If you have any questions,

297
00:15:45,280 --> 00:15:47,460
just ask him when he comes out.

298
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:49,680
The Dual Cultivation Ceremony is approaching.

299
00:15:50,280 --> 00:15:51,730
If I don't call you,

300
00:15:52,510 --> 00:15:53,960
don't bother me again.

301
00:15:57,840 --> 00:15:59,710
I want to improve my cultivation

302
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:01,820
to the level of Nascent Soul within 2 months.

303
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:04,970
Who...

304
00:16:07,280 --> 00:16:08,570
Who are you ?

305
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:15,330
Is there such a pill ?

306
00:16:16,630 --> 00:16:18,010
Who the hell are you !?

307
00:16:50,980 --> 00:16:53,560
Killing Sun Zhenwei is easy.

308
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:54,920
But we have to wait

309
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:58,380
for my cultivation to be high enough so no one can oppose us

310
00:16:58,160 --> 00:17:00,650
both in the Cloud Sky Sect and in Chu.

311
00:17:01,520 --> 00:17:03,070
Sounds good ?

312
00:17:14,890 --> 00:19:28,020
All individuals have a part of Yin and Yang but Yin energy is often associated with women / purity / cold. And Yang energy on the contrary is associated with men / warmth / fire.
Primordial Yin in a cultivation context means specifically the virginity of a woman that was preserved and contains immense energy / potential for a Yang-type individual. Dual cultivation is the way to harness both Yin and Yang in a complementary way through sharing both individuals' energy. In the event that one is stronger than the other, the weaker (generally the woman) will become the other's "cultivation furnace".
The term "cultivation furnace" is more widely used for any kind of exploitation of someone else to further one's cultivation.

313
00:17:23,210 --> 00:17:27,340
I've had my share of wounds,

314
00:17:25,250 --> 00:17:27,340
now I want to fight back.

315
00:17:27,170 --> 00:17:30,900
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

316
00:17:30,730 --> 00:17:36,820
that's blocking all my hopes

317
00:17:33,610 --> 00:17:36,820
for life ?

318
00:17:38,370 --> 00:17:42,580
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

319
00:17:40,090 --> 00:17:42,580
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

320
00:17:42,650 --> 00:17:45,980
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

321
00:17:46,090 --> 00:17:51,980
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

322
00:17:48,810 --> 00:17:51,980
out of reach.

323
00:17:53,090 --> 00:17:57,460
Immortals

324
00:17:54,130 --> 00:17:57,460
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

325
00:17:57,490 --> 00:18:01,500
Renegades

326
00:17:58,250 --> 00:18:01,500
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

327
00:18:01,250 --> 00:18:05,340
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

328
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:05,340
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

329
00:18:05,330 --> 00:18:09,460
because I don't see the harm in that.

330
00:18:11,210 --> 00:18:17,260
My new body opens its eyes

331
00:18:13,730 --> 00:18:17,260
and awakens from its dream.

332
00:18:17,130 --> 00:18:24,820
I have overcome many trials

333
00:18:19,250 --> 00:18:24,820
to get this body back.

334
00:18:24,770 --> 00:18:32,460
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

335
00:18:28,810 --> 00:18:32,460
I can still see.

336
00:18:32,610 --> 00:18:41,820
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

337
00:18:36,570 --> 00:18:41,820
by my own hands.

338
00:18:57,010 --> 00:19:03,220
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

339
00:18:59,730 --> 00:19:03,220
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

340
00:19:02,970 --> 00:19:10,780
With a flick of a finger,

341
00:19:04,410 --> 00:19:10,780
only my indomitable heart remains.

342
00:19:10,570 --> 00:19:20,180
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

343
00:19:16,530 --> 00:19:20,180
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

344
00:19:20,170 --> 00:19:28,020
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

345
00:19:22,690 --> 00:19:28,020
like the descent of a god.
